# VCS — GitLab

Required env: `GITLAB_TOKEN` (or `glab auth login`).

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=gitlab (vcs) -->

- Open MR → `glab mr create --title "..." --description-file body.md`
- Fetch MR → `glab mr view <num>`
- Diff → `glab mr diff <num>`
- Pipelines → `glab pipeline status`
- Release → `glab release create v<X> --notes-file CHANGELOG.md`

